          "document_id": "med-doc-a62f2b3665782f35b7df",
          "domain": "medical",
          "text": "your body does not make enough insulin or if the insulin doesn't work the way it should, glucose can't get into your cells. It stays in your blood instead. Your blood glucose level then gets too high, causing pre-diabetes or diabetes.",
